  :help
  ["Clears a HelmRelease's Helm storage so the next action is an install"
   ""
   "What it does:"
   "  picks one HelmRelease by namespace and name (--namespace and --name, or interactively), then:"
   "  1/8 🔬 Read the HelmRelease, its owner and its storage - reads and reports"
   "  - asks once to confirm every step below (destructive - type yes)"
   "  2/8 ⏸  Suspend the owner (Kustomization or ResourceSet) that renders the HelmRelease - suspend the owner that renders the HelmRelease, verified"
   "  3/8 ⏸  Suspend the HelmRelease and wait for a running action to finish - suspend the HelmRelease, verified"
   "  4/8 🗑  Delete the release's workloads - delete the release's workloads (destructive), verified"
   "  5/8 🗑  Delete the release's volumes - delete the release's volumes - their data is lost (destructive), verified, asks again"
   "  6/8 🗑  Delete the Helm storage and confirm it is empty - delete the release's Helm storage (destructive), verified"
   "  7/8 ▶  Resume the HelmRelease, which installs - resume the HelmRelease, verified"
   "  8/8 ▶  Resume the owner (Kustomization or ResourceSet) - resume the owner that renders the HelmRelease, verified"
